WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.625
Open Home, then Pantry. This screen records food you have at home. Search before

00:05.625 --> 00:10.653
adding something, so you can check whether the same item is already recorded.

00:15.400 --> 00:21.011
Choose Add item. Only the item name is required. Add an amount, unit, storage

00:21.011 --> 00:26.404
location or pack details if you know them. Use packaging for expiry dates.

00:30.400 --> 00:35.878
Open a saved item to update its amount or mark it running low. Use a separate pack

00:35.878 --> 00:40.955
when needed. Do not treat a recorded expiry date as proof that food is safe.

00:45.400 --> 00:50.831
After shopping, review pantry updates when recording the purchase or receipt. Select

00:50.831 --> 00:56.133
only what came home. Check whether to restock an existing pack, and avoid entering

00:56.133 --> 00:57.685
the same purchase twice.
